3","e":"dks","d":"2018-11-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Lee Belitsky","x":"There's been some devaluation of the yuan since the tariffs have announced.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/28/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q3-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"DKS 2018 Q3","e":"dks","d":"2018-11-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lee Belitsky","x":"We'll be negotiating with our vendors to absorb some of that, and some of it will come through and we'll have to, in some cases, raise our prices to our customers along the way.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/28/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q3-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"DKS 2018 Q3","e":"dks","d":"2018-11-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Lee Belitsky","x":"So, we see this being much less promotional this year than it was last year, which is one of the reasons we're able to continue to increase our guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/28/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q3-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"DKS 2018 Q4","e":"dks","d":"2019-03-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Edward W. Stack","x":"It was -- not much of it was related to tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/12/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q4-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"DKS 2018 Q4","e":"dks","d":"2019-03-12","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Sam Poser","x":"And then secondly, the inventory levels or the inventory decision to bring stuff early, was any of that based on the potential change of tariffs when those decisions were made to move stuff up?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/12/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q4-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"DKS 2018 Q4","e":"dks","d":"2019-03-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Tom Nikic","x":"So it's $60 million of investments, partially offset by $30 million of cost savings which yields a net $30 million headwind for the year, a