nc-dks-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"DKS 2019 Q2","e":"dks","d":"2019-08-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Edward Stack","x":"And I can tell you that we were pleasantly surprised at the lack of of a meaningful price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/22/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"DKS 2019 Q2","e":"dks","d":"2019-08-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William Gaertner","x":"Thanks, I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/22/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"DKS 2019 Q3","e":"dks","d":"2019-11-26","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Lauren Hobart","x":"These new fulfillment centers have expanded our direct-to-consumer capacity and along with our new strategic delivery partnership with FedEx have successfully reduced delivery times to our athletes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/27/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"DKS 2019 Q3","e":"dks","d":"2019-11-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Lee Belitsky","x":"Our updated earnings guidance is based on estimated 89 million average diluted shares outstanding and includes the expected impact from all tariffs currently in effect, as well as any new tariffs that are slated to go into effect later this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/27/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"DKS 2019 Q3","e":"dks","d":"2019-11-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"William Tang","x":"So, the tariff impact, you touched on a little bit in your opening remarks.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/27/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"DKS 2019 Q3","e":"dks","d":"2019-11-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lee Belitsky","x":"And we do get some of our products from China and the momentum around pushing through price increases, related tariffs has been has been pretty slow, what we see in our space, either through negotiating better deals coming from the factories or moving selectively some production not seeing yet…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/27/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"DKS 2019 Q3","e":"dks","d":"2019-11-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lee Belitsky","x":"And as I said, the momentum to raise prices anywhere through the supply chain has been pretty slow so far -- what we're seeing so far.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/27/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"DKS 2019 Q3","e":"dks","d":"2019-11-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Chris Svezia","x":"…abouts on the SG&A side within the operations that act as offsets to a degree to some of the investments are those cases abilities or is that possibly still within the business model to act as offsets or you're nearing the end of finding those those cost savings to offset some of the investment?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/27/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"DKS 2019 Q4","e":"dks","d":"2020-03-10","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Will","x":"What is the tariff impact look like for FY20 for you guys on gross margin?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/10/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"DKS 2019 Q4","e":"dks","d":"2020-03-10","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Edward W. Stack","x":"We've been able to kind of negotiate our way through a lot of these tariffs and the overall tariff impact on us on our cost has been pretty modest.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/10/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"DKS 2019 Q4","e":"dks","d":"2020-03-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lee J. Belitsky","x":"This included a pre-tax -- pre-tax restructuring charges of $48.8 million related to our decision to remove hunt from over 400 stores in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/10/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"DKS 2019 Q4","e":"dks","d":"2020-03-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Edward W. Stack","x":"As we said the footwear business is very strong, but we've also been very clear on our target for the -- that high school athlete, our baseball business, we're going to restructure our -- our golf business, restructuring our soccer business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/10/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"DKS 2020 Q2","e":"dks","d":"2020-08-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lee J. Belitsky","x":"There were lot of -- there were a lot of pieces in there, furlough savings, we had some small reductions in force that are involved.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/26/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q2-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"DKS 2020 Q2","e":"dks","d":"2020-08-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Peter Benedict","x":"First, just may be -- may be an update on occupancy cost reduction, your cost -- your progress on that front with some of your landlords.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/26/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q2-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"DKS 2020 Q3","e":"dks","d":"2020-11-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Joe Feldman","x":"But are you think -- rethinking what the right size of the store might be, the format of it, do you even need as many stores in some markets given the way e-commerce is playing out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/24/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"DKS 2020 Q4","e":"dks","d":"2021-03-09","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Lauren R. Hobart","x":"Beyond online shopping, through our game changer technology, we will enhance our scorekeeping and live streaming offering for youth sports with video on demand, all delivered through a premium subscription service.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/09/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"DKS 2021 Q1","e":"dks","d":"2021-05-26","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Lee J. Belitsky","x":"We are maintaining our guidance on buying back $200 million of -- at least $200 million of stock this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"DKS 2021 Q2","e":"dks","d":"2021-08-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lee J. Belitsky","x":"In addition, we were able to pass through selective price increases to cover higher supply chain and input costs and saw a favorable sales mix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/25/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"DKS 2021 Q2","e":"dks","d":"2021-08-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lee J. Belitsky","x":"Well, we've taken certain price increases primarily in hardlines categories over the course of the year this year, but there hasn't been like a specific schedule for them.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/25/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"DKS 2021 Q3","e":"dks","d":"2021-11-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Navdeep Gupta","x":"In addition, we were able to pass through selective price increases to help cover merchandise cost increases from higher supply chain and input costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/23/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"DKS 2021 Q3","e":"dks","d":"2021-11-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lauren R. Hobart","x":"In terms of where we're taking price increases, I wanted to mention a couple of things.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/23/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"DKS 2021 Q3","e":"dks","d":"2021-11-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Lauren R. Hobart","x":"We announced today that we've raised our full-year guidance for the third time this year, and now expect our comp sales to increase between 24% and 25%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/23/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"DKS 2021 Q3","e":"dks","d":"2021-11-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Lauren R. Hobart","x":"But we are really feeling good and increasing our guidance each quarter on Q4.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/23/dicks-sporting-goods-inc-dks-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"DKS 2025 Q1","e":"dks","d":"2025-05-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Lauren Hobart","x":"With all of this in mind, we are reaffirming the guidance we provided for 2025, which includes the expected impact from all tariffs currently in effect.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/28/dicks-dks-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2025 Q1","e":"dks","d":"2025-05-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Navdeep Gupta","x":"As Lauren mentioned, our guidance includes the expected impact from all tariffs currently in effect.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/28/dicks-dks-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2025 Q1","e":"dks","d":"2025-05-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Adrienne Yih","x":"For you, it's about, you know, the price increases or the, you know, inevitable price increases, I might say.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/28/dicks-dks-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2025 Q1","e":"dks","d":"2025-05-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Adrienne Yih","x":"It seems like at this level of the 30% China, 10% elsewhere, that the price increases needed are not terribly daunting, I would say.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/28/dicks-dks-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2025 Q1","e":"dks","d":"2025-05-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Lauren Hobart","x":"And that's why we were able to just confirm our guidance is that we believe with the tariffs that are known to date, we can manage, and we are continuing to do that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/28/dicks-dks-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2025 Q2","e":"dks","d":"2025-08-28","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Adrienne Yih","x":"Seemingly, the retail channel, the wholesale part of their business, is doing better than maybe their own DTC.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/28/dicks-dks-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2025 Q2","e":"dks","d":"2025-08-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Navdeep Gupta","x":"Our updated guidance reflects our strong Q2 performance and includes the expected impact from all tariffs currently in effect.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/28/dicks-dks-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2025 Q2","e":"dks","d":"2025-08-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Lauren Hobart","x":"As you look to the back half, we just did take up our top line and bottom line guidance, and that includes all of the impact of tariffs that we see.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/28/dicks-dks-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2025 Q2","e":"dks","d":"2025-08-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lauren Hobart","x":"We've seen some sporadic price increases, but they are surgical and not across the board.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/28/dicks-dks-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2025 Q2","e":"dks","d":"2025-08-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lauren Hobart","x":"There have been some selective price increases, but we and our brand partners are very surgical about when, where, and how much we can bring in some minor price increases, you know, to offset some of the tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/28/dicks-dks-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2025 Q2","e":"dks","d":"2025-08-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Lauren Hobart","x":"Today, we're raising our full-year outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/28/dicks-dks-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2025 Q2","e":"dks","d":"2025-08-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Lauren Hobart","x":"So I'm very pleased that we are navigating well and still increasing our guidance and our gross margin for the back half.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/28/dicks-dks-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2025 Q3","e":"dks","d":"2025-11-25","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Ed Stack","x":"Post-COVID, Foot Locker did not react quickly enough as its largest brand pivoted toward a direct-to-consumer model, leaving Foot Locker with the wrong inventory—too much of what didn't sell and not enough of what did sell.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/dicks-sporting-goods-dks-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2025 Q3","e":"dks","d":"2025-11-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Navdeep Gupta","x":"Our updated guidance reflects our strong Q3 performance and includes the expected impact from all tariffs currently in effect.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/dicks-sporting-goods-dks-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2025 Q3","e":"dks","d":"2025-11-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Julie Wasserman","x":"Tariff costs, and the other inputs we discussed last quarter, like the GameChanger business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/dicks-sporting-goods-dks-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2025 Q3","e":"dks","d":"2025-11-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ed Stack","x":"This means clearing out unproductive inventory, closing underperforming stores, and rightsizing assets that don't align with our go-forward vision for the Foot Locker business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/dicks-sporting-goods-dks-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2025 Q3","e":"dks","d":"2025-11-25","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Lauren Hobart","x":"Today, we are raising our full-year outlook for the DICK'S business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/dicks-sporting-goods-dks-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2025 Q3","e":"dks","d":"2025-11-25","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Robbie Ohmes","x":"My first question is I know we're going to be talking a lot about Foot Locker today, but on the 5.7% comp, etcetera, and you raised guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/dicks-sporting-goods-dks-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2025 Q4","e":"dks","d":"2026-03-12","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Christopher Horvers","x":"Presumably, there was some inflation from tariffs as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/12/dicks-dks-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2025 Q4","e":"dks","d":"2026-03-12","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Navdeep Gupta","x":"As of today, we will reiterate the outlook that I had shared.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/12/dicks-dks-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2026 Q1","e":"dks","d":"2026-05-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Edward Stack","x":"From rising valuation to professional sports teams, to the level of investment from streaming platforms and networks, and the strong demand from advertisers to be a part of live sports.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/27/dicks-dks-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2026 Q1","e":"dks","d":"2026-05-27","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Lauren Hobart","x":"Earlier this year, Game Changer launched the most comprehensive product update in its history , introducing 10 ADP live streaming, automated game highlight reels and a new suite of AI-powered coaching tools designed to help coaches Coach smarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/27/dicks-dks-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2026 Q2","e":"dks","d":"2026-08-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Lauren Hobart","x":"Together, the contributions from these businesses plus tariff refunds recognized during the quarter helped offset the promotional pressure we saw across parts of the athletic footwear and apparel marketplace.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/01/dicks-sporting-goods-dks-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2026 Q2","e":"dks","d":"2026-08-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Navdeep Gupta","x":"The improvement was driven by strong growth in DICK'S Media Network and GameChanger as well as the benefit from tariff refunds recognized during the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/01/dicks-sporting-goods-dks-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2026 Q2","e":"dks","d":"2026-08-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Lasser","x":"assets within that broader Foot Locker umbrella, and under what conditions for the market would you need to see in order to move from improving -- trying to improve the performance of the business to rightsizing that organization?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/01/dicks-sporting-goods-dks-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DKS 2026 Q2","e":"dks","d":"2026-08-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Navdeep Gupta","x":"We are reducing our full year outlook to reflect the same footwear marketplace pressures, which are having a more significant impact on Foot Locker as well as continued challenges in